        "created_at": "2015-01-19T11:10:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I like the seperate advanced cards. Whenever I make use of them, that card goes in my 'first card played slot' under the big ones, like a card from the deck itself. It helps remind me that its there and that I am playing on advanced.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
